Fantastic game in spork. Dwarven arc, with a CoMR, AoR, speed boots,
the Orb of Detection and a highly enchanted unicorn horn. Using a
magic lamp as a light source because I don't need the wishes yet. Pet
bone devil and black dragon in tow.

Found a dead knight on DL 20, in room bordered by lava, killed by a
nearby Master Mind Flayer, with the blessed +6 Grayswandir on the
floor.

Zap the mind flayer with slow monster, grab Grayswandir, mount the
knight's horse, zap it with speed monster and escape upstairs to
increase my saber skill level. Wish for a WoD. Back down for the
battle.

Turns out, the Master Mind Flayer has an AC of -19, so I figure it's
wearing Dragon Scale Mail  Sure enough, a hit from the WoD does
nothing. Gray Dragon almost certainly. I figure, though, with a fast
horse and speed boots, I can stay ahead  and whack him good before he
drains my brain completely.

Epic fight. I lose 6 Int. before he finally goes down. Yay! I win! +3
GDSM! +4 Gauntlets of Dexterity! An AC of -25 and I've not even found
a scroll of enchant armor yet! WHOOHOO!

I quaff a blessed potion of restore ability (unihorns don't help lost
stats in Spork) loot the rest of the dead knight's BoH and trot off to
seek further glory deeper in the dungeon ... promptly leading my horse
directly into the lava.

"You fry to a crisp. DYWYPI?"


